### Version

42.6-64

### Problem Description

For example, when exporting `e:\\a.zip\\01.png`, the following script is used:

```javascript
var bookName = nv.Book.Path.split('\\');
bookName = bookName[bookName.length - 1];
var saveImagePath = "d:\\comic\\" + bookName;
param = {
    "Mode": "Original",
    "ExportFolder": saveImagePath
};
nv.Command.ExportImage.Patch(param).Execute();
```

The image will be correctly exported as `d:\\comic\\a.zip\\01.png`.

However, when exporting `e:\\b\\01.png` (where `b` is a folder), nothing will be exported, even though the export is reported as successful.

